  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UN joint program for strengthening inclusive social cohesion and economic resilience in Abyei area, Sudan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In Rule of Law component will continue to address the post-peace realities in Abyei. Community Peacebuilding activities will be primarily focused on local level community peacebuilding issues and in support of recommended activities for UN initiatives. The gender equality and combat with SGBV component will strengthen protection by working with all stakeholders to reduce protection risks, sexual and gender-based violence (SGBV) and implement comprehensive protection responses with a focus on people with specific vulnerabilities.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The joint programme has five main strategic x-x-objectives - identified through consultative and participatory processes with the involvement of UN AFPs, UNISFA, INGOs, CBOs and concerned stakeholders&#xcee4;&#xbba4;&#xb2c8;&#xd2f0; &#xb0b4; &#xc8fc;&#xbbfc; &#xc0dd;&#xacc4;&#xc218;&#xb2e8; &#xc811;&#xadfc;&#xc131; &#xac15;&#xd654; &#xbc0f; &#xacbd;&#xc81c;&#xd65c;&#xb3d9; &#xae30;&#xd68c;&#xd5a5;&#xc0c1;</narrative>
  </description>
